The action performed on a middle-click
Selects the action performed when middle-clicking on the main game area. If a middle mouse button is not available, this action can be performed by left- and right-clicking simultaneously or by left-clicking while holding the control key.
The action performed on a right-click
Selects the action performed when right-clicking on the main game area.
The speed used to display animations
Adjusts the speed at which the in game animations are displayed.
Prevent the player from making fatal moves
If checked, the game will ignore any move that would result in the immediate death of the hero (other than random teleports and waiting out the round).
The selected set of game rules
Selects the set of game rules to be used in the next game.
The selected game theme
Selects the theme used to display all in game elements.
